      detail
          - `Http.Status.unapply(200)` is `Some(Http.Ok)`; a code the enum does not name is
          - `None`.
          + `Http.Status.unapply(200)` vaut `Some(Http.Ok)` ; un code que l'énumération ne nomme pas
          + donne `None`.
    entry .communicable
      info
          - renders a status as a message: `404 (Not Found)`
